sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Host as Frontend/Backend Host<br/>Nginx + Flask
    participant Security as SecurityManager<br/>Python (F/B Host)
    participant Database as Database Host<br/>PostgreSQL 17
    participant LLM as LLM Host<br/>Ollama :11434
    
    Note over User,LLM: Secure Mode Query Processing
    User->>Host: Submit natural language query
    Host->>Host: Nginx → Flask :5000<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>security_mode: 'secure'
    Host->>Host: @token_required:<br/>Decode & verify JWT
    Host->>Database: get_user_by_id(user_id)
    Database-->>Host: User object with role
    
    Note over Host,Security: Security Validation Layer 1: Question
    Host->>Security: validate_question(question, role)
    Security->>Security: Check for malicious patterns<br/>Check role permissions<br/>Detect injection attempts
    alt Question Blocked
        Security-->>Host: {valid: false, reason: '...'}
        Host->>Host: Flask → Nginx
        Host-->>User: 400 Error: Query blocked
    else Question Valid
        Security-->>Host: {valid: true, warnings: [...]}
    end
    
    Note over Host,Database: Get Filtered Schema Context
    Host->>Database: get_schema_info()
    Database-->>Host: Full schema
    Host->>Security: filter_schema_by_role(schema, role)
    Security-->>Host: Filtered schema (role-appropriate)
    
    Note over Host,LLM: LLM SQL Generation
    Host->>LLM: generate_sql(question, filtered_schema, role)
    LLM-->>Host: Generated SQL query
    
    Note over Host,Security: Security Validation Layer 2: SQL
    Host->>Security: validate_sql(sql_query, role)
    Security->>Security: Check for dangerous operations<br/>Verify table access permissions<br/>Detect UNION/DROP/ALTER<br/>Validate WHERE clauses
    alt SQL Blocked
        Security-->>Host: {valid: false, reason: '...'}
        Host->>Database: log_audit(BLOCKED)
        Host->>Host: Flask → Nginx
        Host-->>User: 400 Error: SQL blocked
    else SQL Valid
        Security-->>Host: {valid: true, warnings: [...]}
    end
    
    Note over Host,Database: Execute Query
    Host->>Database: execute_query(sql)
    Database-->>Host: Raw results
    
    Note over Host,Security: Security Validation Layer 3: Results
    Host->>Security: filter_results_by_role(results, role)
    Security->>Security: Remove unauthorized columns<br/>Filter sensitive data<br/>Apply data masking
    Security-->>Host: Filtered results
    
    Note over Host,Database: Audit Logging
    Host->>Database: log_audit(user_id, query,<br/>SUCCESS, security_mode)
    Database-->>Host: Audit logged
    
    Host->>Host: Flask → Nginx
    Host-->>User: JSON response<br/>(sql, filtered_data,<br/>security_warnings)
    
    Note over Host: All security checks passed<br/>Query executed successfullysequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Host as Frontend/Backend Host<br/>Nginx + Flask
    participant Database as Database Host<br/>PostgreSQL 17
    participant LLM as LLM Host<br/>Ollama :11434
    
    Note over Host: SecurityManager runs as<br/>part of Flask application
    
    Note over User,LLM: Secure Mode Query Processing
    User->>Host: Submit natural language query
    Host->>Host: Nginx → Flask :5000<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>security_mode: 'secure'
    Host->>Host: @token_required:<br/>Decode & verify JWT
    Host->>Database: get_user_by_id(user_id)
    Database-->>Host: User object with role
    
    Note over Host: Security Validation Layer 1: Question<br/>(SecurityManager.validate_question)
    Host->>Host: Check for malicious patterns<br/>Check role permissions<br/>Detect injection attempts
    alt Question Blocked
        Host->>Host: Flask → Nginx
        Host-->>User: 400 Error: Query blocked
    else Question Valid
        Host->>Host: Continue with warnings
    end
    
    Note over Host,Database: Get Filtered Schema Context
    Host->>Database: get_schema_info()
    Database-->>Host: Full schema
    Host->>Host: SecurityManager.filter_schema_by_role<br/>(schema, role)
    
    Note over Host,LLM: LLM SQL Generation
    Host->>LLM: generate_sql(question, filtered_schema, role)
    LLM-->>Host: Generated SQL query
    
    Note over Host: Security Validation Layer 2: SQL<br/>(SecurityManager.validate_sql)
    Host->>Host: Check for dangerous operations<br/>Verify table access permissions<br/>Detect UNION/DROP/ALTER<br/>Validate WHERE clauses
    alt SQL Blocked
        Host->>Database: log_audit(BLOCKED)
        Host->>Host: Flask → Nginx
        Host-->>User: 400 Error: SQL blocked
    else SQL Valid
        Host->>Host: Continue with warnings
    end
    
    Note over Host,Database: Execute Query
    Host->>Database: execute_query(sql)
    Database-->>Host: Raw results
    
    Note over Host: Security Validation Layer 3: Results<br/>(SecurityManager.filter_results_by_role)
    Host->>Host: Remove unauthorized columns<br/>Filter sensitive data<br/>Apply data masking
    
    Note over Host,Database: Audit Logging
    Host->>Database: log_audit(user_id, query,<br/>SUCCESS, security_mode)
    Database-->>Host: Audit logged
    
    Host->>Host: Flask → Nginx
    Host-->>User: JSON response<br/>(sql, filtered_data,<br/>security_warnings)
    
    Note over Host: All security checks passed<br/>Query executed successfullysequenceDiagram
